'''Ba-Ba's Phantom''' is a monster encountered in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It is summoned alongside [[Zebak's Phantom]] by [[Tumeken's Warden]] in the third phase of the final battle.

Ba-Ba's phantom will only attack by launching boulders at the player, which can be avoided by walking a tile away from the targeted spot.

